# Story difficulty's hand: identical to main.scene.dry except that it holds four cards. Keep the two in step.
title: The Senate
is-hand: true
max-cards: 4
on-arrival: {!
SW.everyVisit(Q);
Q.coalition_label = Q.coalition_name + (Q.minority_govt ? ' (minority)' : '');
!}

[? if time = 1 : {!<div class="tutorial">!}**How a turn works.** Click a *deck* below to draw a card into your hand (on Story it holds four). Then click a card in your hand to play it. Playing a card ends the turn, and the galaxy moves on to the next quarter. Your advisors, shown as pinned cards at the bottom, can act without ending the turn, but only once every few turns.{!</div>!} ?]

[? if finale : {!<div class="alert">!}**The Last Days.** Each card you play now takes a day. Events will move very fast.{!</div>!} ?]

Supreme Chancellor **[+ chancellor +]** leads the [+ coalition_label +][? if rc_in_govt : , and the Caucus sits in government?][? if not rc_in_govt : . The Caucus is in opposition?].[? if rc_chairs > 0 : The Caucus chairs [+ rc_chairs +] Senate committee(s). ?]

[? if war : The Clone Wars grind on: the front is [+ war_balance : war +]. ?][? if not war and dooku_movement : The Separatist crisis deepens. [+ seceded_total +]% of the Senate's delegations have walked out. ?][? if emergency_powers > 0 : The Chancellor holds [+ emergency_powers : powers +] emergency powers. ?]

[? if capital <= 0 : *The Caucus's coffers are empty. Patron Contributions or Routine Senate Business will help.* ?]

- @caucus_deck
- @senate_deck
- @last_days_deck
- #advisor

@caucus_deck
title: Caucus Affairs
is-deck: true
card-image: img/deck_caucus.svg
unavailable-subtitle: Nothing more to draw from this deck right now.

- #caucus_affairs

@senate_deck
title: Senate Affairs
view-if: rc_has_access or rc_chancellor
is-deck: true
card-image: img/deck_senate.svg
unavailable-subtitle: Nothing more to draw from this deck right now.

- #senate_affairs

@last_days_deck
title: The Last Days
view-if: finale
is-deck: true
card-image: img/deck_last_days.svg
unavailable-subtitle: Nothing more to draw from this deck right now.

- #last_days
